{"id":"875a08dc0d50aa7ade3e91168b0bcf1abf89f4cc","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230044","title":"gpt plus 到期了怎么没显示续费","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"hahajingwo","excerpt":"OpenAI - @hahajingwo - gpt plus 订阅 本来是 7.26 号到期的，登录页面版本 chatgpt 设置里面也是看到 26 号到期，但是手机上没显示到期续费还能继续用； codex 本身看是到 8.2 号（因为最近 o","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>gpt plus 订阅 本来是 7.26 号到期的，登录页面版本 chatgpt 设置里面也是看到 26 号到期，但是手机上没显示到期续费还能继续用； codex 本身看是到 8.2 号（因为最近 openai 重置了）；我是土耳其账号 还想继续续看涨没涨价了；有人知道什么是什么时候会显示续费了？</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906616\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fb87cc371a1058e5edbfb950220ccc46?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"a0210077\" data-uid=\"240151\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/a0210077\">a0210077</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 10:54:41 +08:00\">21h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>到期前几天就自动扣费了。如果不足没扣成功，到期后还可以继续用一段时间，然后你的土耳其账号处于欠费状态，充钱进去会补扣<br>另外周额度重置时间是独立的，订阅只控制周额度上限</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906666\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6692903d4bab11363bce194260e5d6a4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"aru\" data-uid=\"42497\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aru\">aru</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 11:03:33 +08:00\">21h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>想继续用就要存进足够的余额：500 里拉<br>别拖，快到期前苹果检测余额不足会给你发邮件。<br>另外，如果 openai 决定对老客户也提价，会提前 1 个月通知你，你同意了才会按新价格续。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906906\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d52654e25f73b286312121083e6adfd5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"IoriSuen\" data-uid=\"737953\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/IoriSuen\">IoriSuen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 11:40:15 +08:00\">20h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可以在订阅里看到啊，apple pay 或 google pay 都可以看到下一次订阅的时间。可以在付费之前取消。或者就直接扣费了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17907070\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b488/4ced/609953_normal.png?m=1720773098\" alt=\"Yzzm\" data-uid=\"609953\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Yzzm\">Yzzm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 12:11:41 +08:00\">20h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/WJVbr5p.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WJVbr5p.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br>不知道和这个有没有关系，早几天看到的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17907169\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1b40/3a13/617575_normal.png?m=1712110142\" alt=\"sadudgh\" data-uid=\"617575\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n             